# Deliberately empty of LFS rules.
#
# Images used to be tracked here through Git LFS. They are not tracked at all
# any more — see the club-pictures block in .gitignore for why — and an LFS rule
# for files git never sees is only a way to mislead the next person reading it.
#
# The rules are still in the older commits that need them, so a checkout of that
# history resolves its pointers as it always did.
